ull Review object with id: Number(info.lastInsertRowid).\n6. getReviews(pluginName): all reviews (any version, flagged or not) for that plugin name, ordered by id.\n7. getAverageRating(pluginName): average of rating over reviews for that plugin where flagged = 0. If there are no unflagged reviews return 0. Use SELECT AVG(rating) as avg FROM reviews WHERE pluginName = ? AND flagged = 0 and handle null.\n8. flagReview(reviewId): UPDATE reviews SET flagged = 1 WHERE id = ?.\n9. getFlaggedReviews(): all rows with flagged = 1.\n10. removeReview(reviewId): DELETE, return info.changes > 0.\n11. getReviewsByUser(userId): all rows for that user ordered by id.\n12. getReviewCount(pluginName): COUNT(*) of all reviews for that plugin name (including flagged, all versions).\n13. Cast query results: stmt.get(...) as Row | undefined or as { avg: number | null } etc., stmt.all(...) as Row[].\n14. Must compile under TypeScript strict with no unused variables.\"","description":"Delegate reviews module to light worker","run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2578,"cache_read_input_tokens":37199,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2578},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f5d1419-0467-4de4-bf0b-2cd92ee62a86","uuid":"ac436886-f903-46a8-86ca-a33097d532b4","request_id":"req_011CdP3T1p5ujCmMhLSNSoWM"}
